.TH "hare-cache" "1" "2026-06-01"
.PP
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.PP
hare cache \- inspect and manage the build cache
.PP
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.PP
\fBhare cache\fR [-hc]
.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBhare cache\fR provides tools to manage the build cache.\& If no options are
supplied, the path and disk usage of the cache are printed.\&
.PP
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB-h\fR
.RS 4
Print the help text.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-c\fR
.RS 4
Clear the cache.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH "محیط (ENVIRONMENT)"
.PP
The following environment variables affect \fBhare cache\fR'\&s execution:
.PP
.TS
l lx.
T{
\fBHARECACHE\fR
T}	T{
The path to the build cache.\& Defaults to \fB$XDG_CACHE_HOME/hare\fR, or \fB\(ti/.\&cache/hare\fR if \fB$XDG_CACHE_HOME\fR isn'\&t set.\&
T}
.TE
.sp 1
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
\fBhare-build\fR(1), \fBhare-run\fR(1), \fBhare-test\fR(1)
